      "source": "To customize the way individual properties' values should be bound to the predicate a\n<a href=\"QuerydslBinderCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl.binding\"><code>QuerydslBinderCustomizer</code></a> can be specified here. We'll try to obtain a Spring bean of this type but fall\nback to a plain instantiation if no bean is found in the current\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "若要自定义各个属性值与谓词 a 的绑定方式，可在此处指定一个 <a href=\"QuerydslBinderCustomizer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.querydsl.binding\"><code>QuerydslBinderCustomizer</code></a>。我们将尝试从当前的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 中获取该类型的 Spring Bean；若未找到，则回退到直接实例化。",
      "count": 1
    },
